    priory:bitSubtype "Trophy" ;
    priory:zoneName "Cursed Shore" ;
    priory:waypointName "Murdered Dreams Waypoint — [&BCIDAAA=]" ;
    priory:acquisitionHint "Hint: Use the Gloominator to capture the darkness at a portal to Grenth's domain in the battle for the Cathedral of Silence in Cursed Shore. The portals are small brown whirlpools on the ground that apply (unnamed effect), and appear in the Temple of Grenth in Cathedral of Silence. If the statues are corrupted, they will only spawn during the meta event [Group Event] Use portals to fight shades, slay the Risen Priest of Grenth, and protect Keeper Jonez Deadrun (80). If the Pact has control of the temple, there will be a portal in the south section, near the Statue of Grenth." .

